**How to retrieve this data programmatically**

```http
GET https://www.virustotal.com/api/v3/domains/example.org/related?limit=10&cursor=abc&relationship_type=subdomains
Authorization: x-apikey: my_api
Accept: application/json
```

> *Note:* The above HTTP request uses your API key (`my_api`) and sets the requested limit and cursor. The response will contain the `id` and any `context_attributes` for each related object. If you need to paginate further, use the `cursor` value returned in the response.
